00:43:23.080 --> 00:43:27.320
This is bringing up some Clementine Paddleford memories for me, Angela.

723
00:43:28.080 --> 00:43:34.180
A hundred percent Clementine Paddleford and Gwendolyn Trundlebed are friends in a Disney

724
00:43:34.180 --> 00:43:34.640
film.

