00:43:53.940 --> 00:43:57.800
Well, it works perfectly because Dwight, I feel like, is coming in there with all this

732
00:43:57.800 --> 00:44:04.340
sort of like macho energy and he came into Gwendolyn Trundlebed's boudoir of pinkness.

733
00:44:04.340 --> 00:44:05.340
That's what it looks like.

734
00:44:05.340 --> 00:44:06.640
It's very boudoir looking.

