00:45:49.480 --> 00:45:51.420
It's at 1 minute 58 seconds.

783
00:45:51.660 --> 00:45:55.580
Andy is singing the ridiculous version of Andy and the tuna.

784
00:45:55.880 --> 00:45:56.700
You know, that whole part?

785
00:45:57.420 --> 00:46:03.880
And the camera focuses on Jim's reaction and then pushes past Jim.

786
00:46:03.880 --> 00:46:07.500
And Jim goes out of focus and it lands on Pam.

787
00:46:08.140 --> 00:46:13.720
And they both have similar expressions of like, oh, my God, this guy.

788
00:46:14.060 --> 00:46:16.220
And for me, I don't know.

789
00:46:16.400 --> 00:46:17.820
I know I love Jim and Pam so much.

790
00:46:17.900 --> 00:46:19.920
So I don't know if I'm like looking for meaning.

791
00:46:20.340 --> 00:46:24.240
But in that moment, I'm like, they're on the same page.

792
00:46:24.540 --> 00:46:27.000
These two are both in it.

793
00:46:27.140 --> 00:46:29.880
Like they're going to be in it together for this episode.

