00:46:37.260 --> 00:46:38.380
I think so.

797
00:46:38.540 --> 00:46:40.980
And it was just also a beautiful shot.

798
00:46:41.720 --> 00:46:43.420
Just to be a technical nerd.

799
00:46:43.680 --> 00:46:44.960
Like that is a beautiful shot.

800
00:46:45.160 --> 00:46:45.840
I agree.

801
00:46:46.180 --> 00:46:48.340
Well, now Michael arrives to work.

