00:47:09.480 --> 00:47:10.660
That's such a good detail.

816
00:47:10.860 --> 00:47:11.220
I know.

817
00:47:11.380 --> 00:47:11.560
I know.

818
00:47:11.640 --> 00:47:12.620
They catch a few things.

819
00:47:12.720 --> 00:47:13.820
I'm going to sprinkle them through.

820
00:47:14.240 --> 00:47:15.480
I love that.

