00:48:06.670 --> 00:48:07.770
And this time it's Andy.

837
00:48:08.030 --> 00:48:13.690
Andy is taking the spot of Dwight over Michael's shoulder, but he's creeping Michael out.

838
00:48:13.810 --> 00:48:14.810
You can already tell.

839
00:48:15.010 --> 00:48:20.490
Well, there's a way that Michael is always kind of annoyed when Dwight interjects in the

