921
00:53:29.030 --> 00:53:32.810
It's just, I think they just had some hurdles to get over.

922
00:53:34.090 --> 00:53:35.630
Oh, well, that's a nice answer.

923
00:53:35.790 --> 00:53:37.310
I think she meant you, Angela.

924
00:53:37.690 --> 00:53:38.170
Oh!

925
00:53:38.290 --> 00:53:41.030
Did you miss your friend, Oscar, who hadn't been sitting there with you?

926
00:53:41.670 --> 00:53:46.230
But I like how you stayed in character there for that answer.

927
00:53:46.610 --> 00:53:49.270
Well, we were talking so much about Angela Martin.

928
00:53:50.470 --> 00:53:52.430
Well, of course I missed my friend.

929
00:53:52.430 --> 00:53:53.150
Are you kidding?

930
00:53:53.450 --> 00:53:59.250
I didn't have anyone to draw me little crazy cartoons of myself being silly and passing me notes.

931
00:53:59.530 --> 00:54:01.930
You guys are such a little trio over there.

932
00:54:02.210 --> 00:54:04.190
Yeah, I definitely missed him.

933
